{
  "name": "x402-price-check",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "Check an x402 402 Payment Required quote before an agent pays it: compare the price with justweight's list price for that model and token count, and approve only under a max premium and inside an agent-spendcap budget. Library, CLI and MCP tool. Never signs or pays.",
